t":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":11229338319,"name":"[🏆] The Donation Game!","desc":"🏆 Welcome to KreekCraft's Official Donation Game! 🏆\n\nAs of May 29th, 2026, Roblox has officially stopped cross-game transactions. Our entire game relied on any user being able to donate to anyone, so this forced us to shut down. Thank you to all of our players who supported us. We genuinely couldn't have done it without you.","path":"/game/11229338319-the-donation-game","slug":"11229338319-the-donation-game","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0aad534a545864ba84bfbf7dbd867f6ec23a4d2b110592504d9218d3425ea88f.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-cc22a9356452bc193b77a779f9259c64/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":22895434,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-04-25T12:25:40.669Z","creator":{"name":"omelette prep","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":10602062861,"name":"Amazon Trip Around the Blox","desc":"📢Hi Everyone! We have an important announcement:\n\nThis experience will be ending on 30-12-22, meaning this is your last chance to score an Amazon box head!\n\nThank you all for playing 🧡. We hope the delightful memories created here will be treasured forever. Or at least until next time!\n\nJoin Fox and the forest animals as they drive out of our Holiday Kids Gift\nBook and into Amazon Trip Around the Blox! Gather round and compete\nagainst your friends in fun new mini games inspired by each animal.\nComplete quests to earn ⭐ to unlock items!\n\n📅 Check in daily to complete quests for each animal\n👓 Earn coins to redeem items and dress up your avatar\n🎁 FREE ITEM - Play 3 FULL ROUNDS of minigames to get the AMAZON BOX!\n\n\n©2022 Amazon Technologies, Inc., its parent or its affiliates. Amazon and all related marks are trademarks of Amazon Technologies, Inc., its parent or its affiliates. Roblox and the Roblox logo are registered trademarks of Roblox Corporation.\n","path":"/game/10602062861-amazon-trip-around-the-blox","slug":"10602062861-amazon-trip-around-the-blox","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e1f18374a72e3f3d18aecabb2fc72a55bc8ae58c95a36d0393a00195117bbf71.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-c23b09a7ec399258837aaf7b3f0c146c/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":2657631,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-10-04T21:11:19.007Z","creator":{"name":"Amazon","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":9903808883,"name":"[CO-OP] Build a Market Tycoon","desc":"👍 NEW CODE Releasing at 50K LIKES! 👍 \r\n🎮 Brought to you by Voldex! 🎮\r\n\r\nWelcome to Build a Market! Manage your own market by growing fresh plants, keeping your animals fed and happy, selling to customers, and hiring employees to expand your store! Unlock new items to sell and continue to build your market!\r\n\r\n🛒  Build the Biggest Market!\r\n🌻  Grow Crops and Tend to Animals!\r\n💸  Collect the Most Money to Hire Workers!\r\n👥  Visit your Friend's Markets!\r\n🏬  Expand your Market Corporation!\r\n\r\n⚒️ Updates Every Week! Lastest Update ⚒️\r\n - Thief event!\r\n- Overflowing bin market event!\r\n- Goat mount for market 2 completion!\r\nInspired by My Mini Mart mobile game\r\n\r\nTags: Mini, Shelf, Stacking, Job, Tycoon, Supermarket, Market, Store, Voldex","path":"/game/9903808883-build-a-market-tycoon","slug":"9903808883-build-a-market-tycoon","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/c87f7e2f13e6e186371f7940dbfb4220ea0fdb03eb09d16d7770a9fdbbaf2405.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-89974576882f780c80d0f26928131be8/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":27616508,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-07-30T15:35:19.460Z","creator":{"name":"Build a Market","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":10762579692,"name":"[FREE UGC] FASHION KLOSSETTE","desc":"WELCOME TO THE NEW FASHION KLOSSETTE\n\nWe’ve heard you...and we’re so excited to bring you the brand new Fashion Klossette experience.\nThis isn’t just an update, it’s a full-on transformation!\n\n🌀 Step into a fully redesigned world \n🎮 Play through an all-new 3-phase loop\n🧍‍♀️ Style with interactive mannequins\n🛍 Shop the look straight off the runway\n📸 Save your fave fits, share with friends, and build your own lookbook\n💃 Meet your model NPC BFF who hypes you up while you play\n🌍 Take your style anywhere across Roblox\n\n\nThank you for being on this journey with us. 💖 We can’t wait for you to jump in and explore everything we’ve built (with love, glam, and a little sparkle ✨)!","path":"/game/10762579692-fashion-klossette","slug":"10762579692-fashion-klossette","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/65bb5ddb6ed4cc6b1d77a1998580e2ac8692283e7191bf108db5bb11ee8863e6.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-25015234a616dee77de31a8831291474/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":34954929,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-06-02T03:30:42.035Z","creator":{"name":"Karlie Kloss","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":10701984492,"name":"Orangutag! 🦧","desc":"We are working on a new game called \"Monke Tag\" which will be the sequel to Orangutag.\n\nFAQ:\nQ: Will Orangutag still be updated?\nA: Only for bug updates, but no new content updates.\n\nQ: When will Monke Tag be released?\nA: We have no release date as of now. If we do we will update this page to let you know :) For now we're still developing the game.\n\nQ: Will Monke Tag be different than Orangutag?\nA: Yes, so far they are absolutely nothing alike and Monke Tag will have more unique features.\n\nQ: What can I expect from Monke Tag?\nA: You can expect things like an Item Shop, Accessories, Game Modes, and we plan on adding much more!\n(When we say \"Accessories\" we're not talking about Avatar/Roblox Accessories) ","path":"/game/10701984492-orangutag","slug":"10701984492-orangutag","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.m